@page "/"

<PageTitle>OperationsHub</PageTitle>

<div class="py-5">
    <p class="text-uppercase text-primary fw-semibold mb-2">Operations service management</p>
    <h1 class="display-5 fw-semibold">A clear path from request to resolution.</h1>
    <p class="lead text-body-secondary col-lg-8">
        OperationsHub is being built as a secure internal workspace for submitting,
        assigning, tracking, and auditing operational requests.
    </p>

    <div class="alert alert-light border col-lg-8 mt-4" role="status">
        <strong>Milestone 1 complete.</strong>
        MySQL persistence, ASP.NET Core Identity, development demo accounts, and the initial schema migration are ready.
        Request workflows and the sign-in experience arrive in the next milestones.
    </div>
</div>
